   "validatorKey": "y11op_check_write",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Write the Condition</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why must you write Day twice in part (b)?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Each side of OR is a whole condition: a variable, an operator and a value.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Write each condition. Use the variable names given.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response is-line\"><label for=\"y11op-check-write-a\">(a) Mark is from 0 to 100, including 0 and 100. [1]</label><input id=\"y11op-check-write-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-write-a\" aria-label=\"Check: Write the Condition part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response is-line\"><label for=\"y11op-check-write-b\">(b) Day is 6 or Day is 7. [1]</label><input id=\"y11op-check-write-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-write-b\" aria-label=\"Check: Write the Condition part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y11op-check-write-c\">(c) Age is 25. Is Age &gt;= 13 AND Age &lt;= 19 TRUE or FALSE? [1]</label><input id=\"y11op-check-write-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-write-c\" aria-label=\"Check: Write the Condition part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y11op-check-write-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y11op-check-write-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"
