   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 2: Write the IF</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why is your program tested with new values each time?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>A condition must be right for every value, not just one. New values find a wrong operator.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Write the program in the box. Press Run. Your program must give the same output as the model program, with new values each time.</p><div id=\"y11op-activity-2\"></div>"
